    "message": "Version 1.1.1: statistical correctness fixes, new tests, worked examples\n\n- Fix bug within component 2/3 likelihood.\n- Fix bug ZIP/ZINB zero formula\n- Rewrite Neighbours_combined with neighbour counting efficient\n- ABC step uses proposed gamma and correctly-scaled epsilon efficiently\n- Remove proposal density from MH ratio\n\n- compute_HMRFHiC_probabilities: max_interactions defaults to NA (no cap)\n- compute_HMRFHiC_probabilities: new consistent_dist argument (default TRUE)\n- process_data: user now specify rescales or zero-pads easily\n- run_chain_betas: per-dataset x_vars subsetting; Windows mc_cores warning\n\n- Remove duplicate R implementations of C++-backed functions\n- Added more comprehensive test suite\n- Added worked examples vignette section for Hi-C and Micro-C\n",
    "time": 1776876286
  },
